---
name: todo-sort
description: Sort a TODO list by its priority tags. Use for "sort my todos". Do NOT use for calendar planning.
---

# todo-sort

1. Read `todo.txt`. Each line holds one item and one tag: `[p1]`, `[p2]`, or `[p3]`.
2. Sort by tag, `[p1]` first. Keep the input order inside a tag.
3. Put an item without a tag last.
4. Return the sorted lines only.
